  "title": "Laotian Grilled Chicken (Ping Gai)",
  "description": "A bounty of cilantro and fresh-ground peppercorns enlivens Chef John&#39;s ping gai, an easy-to-make Laotian grilled chicken served with a sweet, garlicky dipping sauce.",
